# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify SPA fallback.
#
# The app is a client-routed SPA: only index.html exists on disk, so a hard
# refresh or shared link to any deep path (/requests/abc, /profile) would 404
# without this rule. Serve index.html and let the router resolve the path.
#
# 200 (rewrite), not 301/302 — the URL in the address bar must stay intact for
# the router to read it.
/*    /index.html   200
